WEBVTT

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.490
Morioka-san!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.650
Sakurai-san?

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Koiwai Homare

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.630
Is it Koiwai-san?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.290
I-It is. How did you know?

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:02.890
We actually work together.
He's my senior coworker.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:03.760
What?

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.280
Don't mind me. Go ahead and answer it.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.770
Oh, r-right.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.730
Hello?

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.630
You finally picked up!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.240
I'm really sorry.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:20.670
I said I'd be in touch, but I'm on a business
trip, so I just haven't had the time.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.380
Huh? A business trip?

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.410
That's right.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.980
I'm in Osaka.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.010
I'll be sure to pick up a souvenir for you.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.790
Thank you very much.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.920
Wait!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.740
Um, about our get together...

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:36.560
That's right! That's actually why I called.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.090
So about tomorrow...

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.170
Tomorrow?

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.140
Huh? Yeah. It's tomorrow.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:41.710
Huh?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.880
What?!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.030
Don't tell me you thought it was today.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:48.500
I-I did.

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.570
I've been a NEET so long that I can't
keep track of the days of the week.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.720
You're really kind of a klutz in your
own way, aren't you, Morimori-chan?

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.190
Or is it that...

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.570
you were just looking forward
to our date that much?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.280
Wha?!

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.330
D-Don't tease me!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.580
S-Sorry for causing such a commotion.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:13.580
No, no. I get the feeling that
Koiwai's the real problem.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.380
Huh? What's up?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:19.470
Oh, well, I'm in front of
the station at the moment.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.220
And Sakurai-san came by.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.790
Huh? What's up with that? What's going on?

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:26.760
Morimori-chan, can you put the phone on
speaker and hand it to him for a sec?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.350
S-Sure.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.230
Koiwai-san wants to talk to you.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.480
Thank you very much.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.760
Sakurai here. I hope things are going well.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.730
So, Sakura-chan...

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.740
Is Morimori-chan totally
super cute right now?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.240
Huh?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:40.990
Wha?!

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.690
How could you ask him that?!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.540
I'm so embarrassed.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.020
I'm so sorry that there's
nothing cute about me!

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.000
Please give me a break.

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:01.510
Morioka-san looks very cute.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.890
Right now,

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.860
she looks so cute that I'm actually grateful

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.670
you're not around to see it.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.400
Episode 6

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.400
I'm So Embarrassed I Could Die!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.510
So have a little more confidence in yourself.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:21.900
Morioka-san,

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.010
more than you could ever imagine,

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.220
you're...

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.890
Sakurai-san?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.680
You're Koiwai-san's type for sure!

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.640
Huh?!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.280
Seriously?!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.120
Man, I wish I could see you right now!

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.800
This is so frustrating!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.090
I wish it was tomorrow already.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.260
Oh, you're still on for tomorrow, right?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.390
Y-Yes! Of course!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.850
Great. Then can I talk to just
you to finish things up?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:52.730
Sure.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.770
Sorry about all this, but how about
you enjoy tonight with Sakurai-san?

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.690
What?

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.670
It'll be fine!

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.940
He's a super great guy.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.620
Actually, Morimori-chan, you turned
him down once already, didn't you?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.950
He was totally crushed. So how 'bout it?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.220
Right. Right.

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.270
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.180
Right. Then if you'll excuse me...

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.820
S-Sakurai-san.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.070
Y-Yes?

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:25.090
Are...

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.860
Are you free right now?

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.150
Y-Yes!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.410
Cheers.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.480
What should I do? I dunno what to talk about.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.380
Oh, right! I'll start by thanking him for today.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:55.430
Huh?

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:59.750
Wait, what was he doing at the station today?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.170
Maybe he heard from Koiwai-san.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:06.390
But I didn't even tell Koiwai-san
that I'd be there today.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.380
Sorry, Morioka-san.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.130
Huh?

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.700
You got all dressed up for
Koiwai-san, but you got me instead.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:16.640
Huh? Um, er... I-I don't feel that way at all!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.840
Really?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.840
Th-That's right.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:26.150
Um, thanks a lot for today.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.790
I'd like to thank you, too.
For inviting me out tonight.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:34.470
Um, Sakurai-san, how did you know

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:37.350
I had the wrong day for
my outing with Koiwai-san?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.550
Well...

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:48.420
I had heard about you going out
for drinks with him tomorrow.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.210
And so when I happened to see
you on my way home from work,

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.030
I thought maybe you'd mixed up the
days and decided to talk to you.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.560
Ah, so that's it.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.420
Sorry. I'm really embarrassed.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.730
But, well...

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.640
From my perspective, I consider myself lucky.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.570
Now we finally get a chance to talk.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:11.370
Life sure can be strange, can't it?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:17.110
I never would have imagined we
both knew Koiwai-san when we met.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.200
I know.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:23.170
I didn't think we'd ever meet
again in my wildest dreams either.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.960
I'm still really sorry about what happened.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.960
I caused you so much trouble.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:32.660
No, no. No need to apologize so much.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.470
It was just some convenience store chicken.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:35.840
Huh?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:39.960
Huh?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.910
You really don't remember?!

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.640
What? What?!

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.770
I mean, not the hospital thing, the...

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.190
Welcome.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.000
That'll be 99 yen.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.320
Would you like some chicken?

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.580
Oh, no, sorry. I'm fine.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:21.010
Are you feeling all right, Morioka-san?

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.320
Sorry.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:27.660
I didn't think I had such
a low tolerance for alcohol.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.950
I was just spacing out a little.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.770
Really, I'm sorry for everything.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.150
Spring Water

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:39.990
The chicken, the hospital,
your invitation, and...

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.290
for today, too.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.470
No, no, no!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.670
Please don't worry about any of that.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.010
I'm sorry.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:53.740
Then would you mind humoring a request?

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.920
S-Sure! What is it?

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.480
How about we go on a
little walk to help sober up?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.800
Of course, you don't have to.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.480
You could just take the taxi home.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.350
No, um...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.010
I-I'll go.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:27.000
Sorry for troubling you all the time.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.420
No, that's not right.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.500
I should be saying...

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:34.060
Thank you very much, Sakurai-san.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.500
Morioka-san,

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.510
you really are a serious
and kindhearted person.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.130
Huh?

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:49.440
Where have I heard that before?

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.530
I-I didn't do anything worthy of such praise.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.510
Really?

00:09:56.510 --> 00:10:01.310
But it's honestly how I feel, so
please just accept the compliment.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.350
I'm jealous.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.540
If the place where I worked had
seniors like Koiwai-san

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.550
and employees like you, Sakurai-san,

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.420
maybe I could have enjoyed my job more.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.420
Yes.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.600
I'm sure you would have.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:33.520
Koiwai-san really just spends all his
time teasing people and joking around.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.110
But...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:40.360
he seriously considers how I feel
about things, and he supports me.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:45.470
Oh, but make sure you keep it
a secret that I told you that.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:48.000
Huh? But everything you're
saying is so positive.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.470
Knowing him, it'd go straight to his head!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.630
Now I'm looking forward to it.

00:10:58.980 --> 00:10:59.800
Tomorrow, I mean.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.890
I kept wondering things
like if he'd like my haircut,

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.640
or if I'd even be able
to talk to him properly.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:10.140
I was worried about all sorts of things.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.620
But after hearing about Koiwai-san from you,

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:17.450
I can tell he's the kind man
I thought he was. I'm relieved.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.610
It even gave me a chance to talk to you.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.340
I really had a great time tonight.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.550
I feel the same.
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:31.070
Good luck, Morioka-san.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.420
Riverside Osaka

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:39.420
Huh? But why?

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:43.390
Even I'm allowed to change
my mind from time to time.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.370
No way!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:48.390
Something happened! I know it!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:53.030
I mean, you're so bad at giving up that
you accidentally started stalking—

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.150
You're forbidden from ever talking about that!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.830
Really, I'll never get tired of you.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.830
But seriously, you're really okay with this?

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.270
Yes.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.490
Tomorrow's your night out.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.060
I won't be going.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.790
Hayashi-kun hasn't logged in today, either.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:30.190
Maybe he drank so much
that he's still sleeping.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.520
Being a university student sure is nice!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:43.310
I wonder if I gave Morioka-san
the push she needed.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:49.560
Morioka-san has no more
reason to see me anymore.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:54.220
My turn on stage is over with this.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:12:59.890
Morioka-san...

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:12.450
I didn't have a another skirt
on hand that I thought would fit.

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:14.440
I wonder if this is okay...

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.070
Koiwai Homare

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:21.850
H-Hello?

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.740
Hello, it's Koiwai!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.070
Sorry for moving our get
together to an earlier time.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.140
Huh? Were you still asleep?

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.090
Sorry!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.910
But it's almost evening already!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.580
Wake up! It's really about time
to wake up, Morimori-chan!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.180
Don't even worry about it.

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:38.330
But did something happen?

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.950
It's nothing like that.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.790
I just wanted to see you sooner.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.250
If I said that, what would you do?

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.300
K-Koiwai-san!

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:52.100
Just like Sakurai said, you look
totally cute, Morimori-chan!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.100
Osaka Souvenir

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:57.020
D-Don't tease me!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.320
The restaurant I made a reservation
for is just up ahead.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.480
I don't have a lot of experience
with this kind of thing,

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.180
so I'm not really sure about all this.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.690
But it feels like I'm really
being escorted here!

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:29.010
Sakurai-san walked on the
road side of the sidewalk, too.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:32.790
So anyway...

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.620
Did you actually invite
Sakurai out yesterday?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.090
You didn't?

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:42.110
I-I did.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.020
Yup. I already knew!

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.700
Yes, that's what he said.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.370
No, there's no way that's a coincidence.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.370
It's the power of love.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.140
Love? Come on.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.260
No, no, seriously.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.980
But I'm already 30.

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:07.650
I'm practically an old maid.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.190
I'm not the kind of person someone like
Sakurai-san would give a second glance.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.110
If you're an old maid, then what am I at 32?

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:18.090
Sure, Sakurai's younger, but he's still 28.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:22.750
I'm sure he sees you as a woman,
and a fine one at that.

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:26.850
Come on. You're exaggerating, Koiwai-san.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.190
Am I? Oh, Morimori-chan.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.760
I see your glass is empty. I'll order more.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.580
What would you like?
Mind if I order a few things?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.060
N-No! Go right ahead.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:48.830
So, when I was low on health and
totally surrounded with no way out,

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.830
Sakurai took them out all by himself.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.850
Sakurai-san sounds like he's good at games.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.900
I never would have pegged him as a gamer.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.890
Nah, despite how he looks,

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.230
he's a completionist when it comes to games.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:08.030
So is the MMO you play the kind of
game where you shoot-em-up online?

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:11.050
Um, well, there's not much shooting.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.860
Oh, but...

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.500
There are all sorts of enemies,
including zombies.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.030
And you're free to design your
character however you like.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.120
There are lots of weapons
and outfits to choose from.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:26.620
But the biggest reason I like the game

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:29.620
is perhaps because I can use it to talk
to strangers and get to know them.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:32.510
Then as friends, we play together.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.770
I see.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.660
I'm a bit embarrassed to admit it,

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:41.910
but I even asked my online friends for
advice about our get together tonight.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.640
They made me feel like I could do it.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.270
Your online friends, huh?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.520
So was the hair their idea?

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.030
It was.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.530
One of them was in favor of short hair,
and the other was in favor of long.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.880
So I compromised and went for medium length.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.430
That's so very like you!

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.370
But really,

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.880
I think you look lovely.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.660
I like it.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.020
Not just your hair.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.180
You're more upbeat than how
you sounded over the phone.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.650
You look like you're having
fun, so I'm relieved.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:20.390
Most of all, I'm really happy to see how
much effort you put into seeing me tonight.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.470
W-Well...

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.350
If you came looking like you did then,
I'd start to doubt your sensibilities!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.990
I know, right?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.220
I'm gonna go to the men's room.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:41.020
Just order any drink you'd like.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:42.710
S-Sure.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.650
I wonder if I sound weird to him.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:52.420
Even though I know he's just being polite,
it still makes my heart flutter.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.990
Maybe I've had a bit too much to drink.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:17:59.610
I'm back.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.680
Wait, huh?

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.300
I'm sorry.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.730
No, don't worry about it.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:16.280
But it's pretty unusual for you
to not keep on eye on your aggro.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.920
If something's bothering you,
we're all here to lend an ear.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.860
Thank you very much.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:26.080
It's no good. I can't concentrate at all.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.600
Look at her sleeping face!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:38.850
She's completely defenseless!

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:41.540
I won't get in any trouble if I try
something with her like this, right?!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.500
It's totally cool if I take
her home with me, right?

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.100
Sorry! Something sudden
came up, so I'm logging off!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.120
Hey, wai—

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:56.110
She's been like this since yesterday.
I wonder what's up.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.620
There's no way I'd so something like that!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:06.170
I took her back to her place
like a gentleman.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.120
Work up a sweat, didja?

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:10.700
Not really.

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:14.380
I figured it was a joke,
but I dropped by just in case.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.370
Whatever happens between you
two has nothing to do with me.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:26.640
For all that talk, it looks like you
ran straight here at full speed.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.390
N-No, I just, um...

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.040
Anyway, Sakura-chan,

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.820
how did you find Morimori-chan yesterday?

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.400
She said you saw her on
your way home from work.

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.910
But you don't use that
station to commute, do you?

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.000
It was a coincidence.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.790
Honestly, a huge coincidence.

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:55.810
Well, whatever.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.450
Here. This is your souvenir.

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.800
Takoyaki

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.660
Call me when you have a takoyaki party.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.830
I'll help you eat it all.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.060
Takoyaki

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.080
Isn't this a souvenir for me?

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:15.620
I'm beat.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.750
It really feels great to come home.

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:24.110
Oh, right. I'm wearing makeup.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:31.870
I feel like I used up all my luck
with men over the course of two days.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.180
It was like a once-in-a-lifetime
event. Seriously.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.510
But really, I think you look lovely.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.620
I like it.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.700
Right now, she looks so cute
that I'm actually grateful

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.010
you're not around to see it.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.340
Yup.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:00.390
This position is definitely
the most relaxing of all.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.780
To a T

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:07.110
The sound of home!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.270
Nothing makes me feel
more at home than an MMO!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.440
Lily-san isn't online.

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:25.180
Well, I'll go see everyone else for now.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.680
Good evening, Hayashi-san!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.180
It's been a while, Lily-san!

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:38.140
Thanks a lot for the advice
you gave me the other day.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:39.720
It was nothing.

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:42.190
Did you have fun going out for a drink?

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:43.520
Yup!

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:51.200
I'm happy to hear that,

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.240
Morioka-san.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.620
I already made up my mind, didn't I?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:40.270
Next Episode

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:27.910
I'll protect you.

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:29.800
How do I explain this?

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.430
I don't mind going as a group.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:34.220
Is it okay for me to dream a little?

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:39.260
Episode 7, "You and I, and Me and You"

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:40.210
Episode 7
You and I, and Me and You
